bug=20
> report 251083:

> > reassign -1 linux-kernel-di-alpha
> > retitle -1 dont provide reiserfs modules
> > thanks

> > * Helge Kreutzmann <kreutzm@itp.uni-hannover.de> [2004-05-26 18:15]:
